        "heading": "Welcome",
        "exact_text": "Welcome to Twistee Treat of Ocoee, Twistee Treat of Lake Buena Vista, and Ginther's Swirls Website. We have been family-owned and operated since 1994.\n\nTwistee Treat of Ocoee and Twistee Treat of Lake Buena Vista are a direct licensee and have been granted the right to continue to use the name from Twistee Treat USA. If you need information regarding new or other Twistee Treat locations, please contact Twistee Treat USA directly at TwisteeTreat.com.\n\nIf you have any problems or questions regarding our Twistee Treat of Ocoee location, please contact us directly at Ginther300@yahoo.com . If you have any problems or questions regarding Twistee Treat of Lake Buena Vista or Ginther's Swirls, please contact us directly alg07c@my.fsu.edu .\n\nThank you for your continued support of our family businesses and the entire Twistee Treat and Ginther family of businesses.",
